## Course Overview

This course covers the dynamic modeling, analysis, and feedback control system design principles for industrial processes. Students gain practical insights into controller tuning and stability criteria for single-input single-output (SISO) control loops.

## Prerequisites

- Differential Equations
- Basics of Linear Systems Theory

